    Bug 2014903 - Part three - Refactor Ews message creation.  r=edicharry


    This patch performs has two (related) goals:
    1. Move msgDB manipulation out of the EwsClient (in rust).
    2. Separate message creation code from the message copy code.
       Historically, message creation has been very intertwined with message
       copying logic, and this causes a lot of complexity. This patch goes
       most of the way toward separating them, for EWS/graph at least.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D285664

